subckt cmp_physical_v14_pdk110_54 (vp vn out vdd vss)
RB (vdd nb) resistor r=100000
MB (nb nb vss vss) nch w=1e-06 l=1e-06 ad=4.8e-13 as=4.8e-13 pd=2.96e-06 ps=2.96e-06 nrd=0.27 nrs=0.27 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
MT (tail nb vss vss) nch w=2e-06 l=1e-06 ad=9.599999999999999e-13 as=9.599999999999999e-13 pd=4.96e-06 ps=4.96e-06 nrd=0.135 nrs=0.135 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
MP (left vp tail vss) nch w=1e-06 l=5.000000000000001e-07 ad=4.8e-13 as=4.8e-13 pd=2.96e-06 ps=2.96e-06 nrd=0.27 nrs=0.27 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
MN (sense vn tail vss) nch w=1e-06 l=5.000000000000001e-07 ad=4.8e-13 as=4.8e-13 pd=2.96e-06 ps=2.96e-06 nrd=0.27 nrs=0.27 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
PL (left left vdd vdd) pch w=2e-06 l=1e-06 ad=9.599999999999999e-13 as=9.599999999999999e-13 pd=4.96e-06 ps=4.96e-06 nrd=0.135 nrs=0.135 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
PR (sense left vdd vdd) pch w=2e-06 l=1e-06 ad=9.599999999999999e-13 as=9.599999999999999e-13 pd=4.96e-06 ps=4.96e-06 nrd=0.135 nrs=0.135 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
XI0 (sense inv vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_55
XI1 (inv out vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_7
